    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "AmericanAirlines\nWORLDWIDE\nTimetable\nPASSENGER SCHEDULE AND CARGO GUIDE\nTOVEMBER 1, 1993\nGUÍA DE HORARIOS PARA PASAJEROS\nY SERVICIO DE CARGA\nAmerican agle®\nAmerican\nAMERICAN\nBRINGS YOU\nMORE OF\nAMERICA.\nA'A\nAmericanAirlines*\nWorldCupUSA94\nOFFICIAL AIRLINE",
      "GET\nMORE\nMILEAGE\nOUTOF\nYOUR\nCREDIT CARD.\nCITIBANK+\n\"Advantage®\nAmerican Airlines*\n4128\n4128 0012\n345b\n7890\nEXPIRATION DATE\nVALID FROM\n09/92\n08/31/94 CV\nVISA\nL\nWALKER\nMEMBER 02\nThe Citibank A'Advantage card\nearns you free worldwide travel on\nAmerican Airlines.\nAA\nEvery time you use the Citibank AAdvantage MasterCarde or Visa® to\nmake a purchase, you'll earn one Advantage mile for every dollar you\nspend. It's the quickest way to earn free travel on American Airlines.\nYou can redeem your AAdvantage miles for travel awards to exciting destinations in the\nUnited States, Europe, Asia, Australia, Latin America, and the Caribbean.\nSo apply today for the Citibank Advantage card. The annual fee is $50.* No other card\ngives you more ways to earn free travel on American Airlines.\nPick up an application at any American Airlines airport location or city ticket office.\nTO APPLY BY PHONE, CALL 1-800-FLY-4444, EXT. 60\nAmerican Airlines and Advantage are registered trademarks of American Airlines, Inc. American Airlines reserves the right to change the\nAdvantage program at any time without notice. The Citibank AAdvantage card is issued by Citibank (South Dakota), NA.\n*The Annual Percentage Rate for purchases is currently 15.4% and may vary quarterly. The Annual Percentage Rate for cash advances is 19.8%. If a\nfinance charge is imposed, the minimum is 50c. There is an additional finance charge for each cash advance transaction equal to 2% of the amount\nof each cash advance transaction; however, it will not be less than $2.00 or greater than $10.00.\n© 1993 Citibank (South Dakota), N.A. Member FDIC."
